<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 5px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row > div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .label-col {
    width: 150px; /* Adjust as needed for alignment */
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .input-col {
    flex-grow: 1;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">DIRECT DEPOSIT AUTHORIZATION AGREEMENT</h1>
  <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0;">(for U.S. bank accounts only; please do not use this form to record international bank account information)</p>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">FINANCIAL INSTITUTION INFORMATION:</h2>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Bank Name:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="financial_institution.bank_name">{{ financial_institution.bank_name }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Bank Branch:</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"><span data-field="financial_institution.bank_branch">{{ financial_institution.bank_branch }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>City:</td>
      <td><span data-field="financial_institution.city">{{ financial_institution.city }}</span></td>
      <td>State:</td>
      <td><span data-field="financial_institution.state">{{ financial_institution.state }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Routing/ABA No:</td>
      <td><span data-field="financial_institution.routing_aba_number">{{ financial_institution.routing_aba_number }}</span></td>
      <td>Zip Code:</td>
      <td><span data-field="financial_institution.zip_code">{{ financial_institution.zip_code }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Select One:</td>
      <td><span data-field="financial_institution.account_type_select">{{ financial_institution.account_type_select }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td><span data-field="financial_institution.account_type_details">{{ financial_institution.account_type_details }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">PAYEE INFORMATION:</h2>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Name of Person or Organization:</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="payee.name">{{ payee.name }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Last four (4) digits of your SSN, EIN, or employee ID no:</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="payee.ssn_last_four">{{ payee.ssn_last_four }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Street Address:</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="payee.street_address">{{ payee.street_address }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">City:</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="payee.city">{{ payee.city }}</span></div>
    <div class="label-col" style="margin-left: 20px;">State:</div>
    <div class="input-col" style="flex: 1;"><span data-field="payee.state">{{ payee.state }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Email:</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="payee.email">{{ payee.email }}</span></div>
    <div class="label-col" style="margin-left: 20px;">Zip Code:</div>
    <div class="input-col" style="flex: 1;"><span data-field="payee.zip_code">{{ payee.zip_code }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Phone Number:</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="payee.phone_number">{{ payee.phone_number }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">The authority of this agreement is to remain in full force and effect until <span data-field="agreement.termination_date">{{ agreement.termination_date }}</span> College has received written notification from me of its termination in such time and such manner as to afford Barnard College and my financial institution to act on it. Should an incorrect amount be deposited into my account, I authorize my financial institution to make the appropriate adjustment.</p>

  <table style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Authorized Signature</td>
      <td style="width: 50%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Date</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Printed Name</td>
      <td style="width: 50%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Title</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%; padding-bottom: 10px;">Select One:</td>
      <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="signature_options.select_one">{{ signature_options.select_one }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 25%; padding-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="signature_options.change_account">{{ signature_options.change_account }}</span></td>
      <td style="width: 20%; padding-bottom: 10px;"><span data-field="signature_options.change_agreement">{{ signature_options.change_agreement }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 20px; margin-top: 40px;">
    <p style="font-weight: bold;">Please include a voided check, bank reference letter, or a screenshot of your account information with this document.</p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">Please return this document with a voided check, bank reference letter, or a screenshot of your account information by</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">mail: <span data-field="return_address.mail_name">{{ return_address.mail_name }}</span> | <span data-field="return_address.mail_street">{{ return_address.mail_street }}</span> | Attn: <span data-field="return_address.attn">{{ return_address.attn }}</span> | <span data-field="return_address.city">{{ return_address.city }}</span>, <span data-field="return_address.state">{{ return_address.state }}</span> <span data-field="return_address.zip">{{ return_address.zip }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">fax: <span data-field="return_address.fax">{{ return_address.fax }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">or email: <span data-field="return_address.email">{{ return_address.email }}</span></p>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">After we've received your documents, you will receive an email from a member of our team asking the best time to call you to verify your account information over the telephone. Please reply to the email; the College cannot set you up for electronic payments until we've verified your information over the telephone.</p>
</div>